  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "A fakataitaiga code, sikima JSON, mo mote tulafono e mafai o faitau ne masini e laiseneina i lalo o te MIT License vagana e taku fakapitoa. E mafai o fakagalueina ne koe i au lava saiti e aunoa mo se tapulaa.",
