  "Commercial use": "Fakaaogaga Fakapisinisi",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "E mana te fesootaiga mo te fakaaogaga fakapisinisi",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Ne fakatonuina mai tua o te Fonotaga Puipuiga AI i Bletchley kae taitai ne Yoshua Bengio fakatasi mo tino poto e silia atu i te 100 mai fenua e lata ki te 30 fakaopoopo ki ei te UN, OECD mo te EU, e fakapotopoto ne te lipoti tutoatasi tenei a faamaoniga faasaienisi o nei aso e uiga ki agavaa mo lamatiaga o te AI maluga — kae fakailoa mai foki e mafai nei e nisi faiga o iloa me kua iloiloina latou kae fetaui ei latou olotou amioga.",
  "Companion media": "Mea Vitiō/Leo Faasoa",
