  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Fakafou fakailoaga aia tatau ki se maketi laisene e mafai o faigaluega, kae se ko se upega matala/tapotu fua.",
  "Copied ✓": "Kua Kopi ✓",
