  "English edition →": "Lomiga Igilisi →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Fakamautinoa ke mafai o fakagalueina ne masini te matala — ke se lafoaia te loto lelei e pei se seai mautinoa i tulafono.",
