  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Te pogai e le mafai ei o pulea ne se ki ioe/fakafiti e tasi te fakaaogaina o fakamatala i te vaitaimi AI — mo te foliga o se vaega aia tatau e ono fai.",
